WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:13.950
We were four probes, one big and three small, dropped into the thick clouds of Venus at different spots. We measured the air all the way down.

2
00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:21.040
We were never meant to survive the landing, but one of us, the Day Probe, did.

3
00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:27.720
It whispered data from the scorching surface for 67 minutes before it fell silent.

4
00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:33.510
We weren't built to survive the landing. One of us did anyway.
